    "intro": "Furnova's accounting engine — sixteen connected modules on a single transactional substrate, posting balanced entries the moment a document is confirmed.",
    "poweredBy": "POWERED BY",
    "tagline": "DOUBLE-ENTRY LEDGER CORE"
  },
